<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell six points to 1,362.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell six points to 1,362.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,362 today from 1,368 on July 18, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1460    13.257	  1465    13.300</p>
<p>   1a   1354 10257.000	  1362 10313.000</p>
